4) ESLint v9 flat config best-practice and multi-project integration documentation (flat-config quality standards, integration, UX, documentation):
- README.md shows ESLint v9 flat config usage with plugin presets:
  """
  Example `eslint.config.js` (ESLint v9 flat config):

  ```js
  // eslint.config.js
  import js from "@eslint/js";
  import traceability from "eslint-plugin-traceability";

  export default [js.configs.recommended, traceability.configs.recommended];
  ```

  ...

  // Quick start flat config example
  export default [
    // Load the traceability plugin's recommended rule set
    traceability.configs.recommended,
  ];
  """
- Detailed ESLint 9, flat config, and multi-environment integration guidance is in user-docs/eslint-9-setup-guide.md, covering:
  - Flat config basics and structure (array of config objects, no extends, import-based composition).
  - JavaScript-only, TypeScript-only, and mixed JS/TS project examples.
  - Monorepo/workspace patterns.
  - Test-file specific configuration.
  - Troubleshooting ESLint configuration section for common flat-config errors.
- Configuration presets are further documented in docs/config-presets.md:
  """
  ## Recommended Preset
  ...
  export default [js.configs.recommended, traceability.configs.recommended];

  ## Strict Preset
  ...
  export default [js.configs.recommended, traceability.configs.strict];
  """
